This pack contains code adapted from NVIDIA's RE-USE repository
(https://huggingface.co/nvidia/NVIDIA-NemotronLabs-RE-USE): the network classes and the STFT settings in
reuse_engine.py, from models/generator_SEMamba_time_d4.py, models/codec_module_time_d4.py,
models/mamba_block2_SEMamba.py and inference.py.

