  SPDX-License-Identifier: OpenMDW-1.1

The OpenMDW-1.1 licence text, with NVIDIA's third-party notices, is in LICENSE.OpenMDW-1.1-NVIDIA.

The Mamba layer is a plain-PyTorch rewrite (no mamba_ssm). It loads the published weights unchanged and matches the
reference maths numerically, but it is not NVIDIA's code path.

The model weights are not part of this pack. They are NVIDIA's (OpenMDW-1.1) and are downloaded separately into
models/reuse/ (see README.md).
